    "title": "Make the chart",
    "sdk": "client.org(orgId).books.accounts.import",
    "row": null,
    "about": "Makes the Organization's chart of accounts from a template. The only template is `us-services`, and Capxul adds its own two \"not decided\" accounts, 4999 Uncategorized income and 6999 Uncategorized expense, and 3990 Opening balance equity, which takes what the Safe already held. Run it once, before anything else in the books.",
    "who": "A member with Manage books.",
