      "call": "Reads each class's token from `Captable.getClass`, its `totalSupply`, and `balanceOf` for every holder Capxul issued to (the founders and each issue's recipient); `Options.pool()` and `allocated()` give the pool and the options granted. `--at` (checkpoints) is not built yet.",
