      "summary": "Moves to `org board threshold`, with no alias. How many Directors must sign is the Signer Gate's threshold setting. Only the Shareholders' top hat may change it: the founder's Safe until the equity install, then the Governor. The Gate keeps the Safe's threshold in line with it.",
      "synopsis": "capxul org board threshold <n> [--confirm]",
      "who": "The founder, until the equity install. After it, the shareholders, through `org vote create`.",
