      "summary": "Every permission is an officer hat on chain (CAP-1101). The install creates a Books, an Invoicing and a People hat under the Board's top hat. Granting mints the hat to the member's personal Safe, and Capxul reads the permission only from Hats. Manage people, an allowance type in beta, is the People hat.",
