      "summary": "Show the grants, or end one when someone leaves: unvested options return to the pool, vested stay exercisable for the window. For founder stock, the same command revokes the vesting grant from the leaving date.",
      "synopsis": "capxul org options show [<id>] · capxul org options end <id> --last-day <date>",
